You need **Node.js 20.20+**, **pnpm**, **Docker** (for Postgres and Mailpit), and **Git**. Docker handles the database and email testing service, so you don't need to install PostgreSQL separately.

This guide is part of the [Next.js Prisma SaaS Kit installation](./overview).

